[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Exit the deprecated load(table) path in the table switch

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[WORK]
UID: WORK-BOARD-TABLE-SWITCH-UNDEPRECATE
TITLE: Exit the deprecated load(table) path in the table switch
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The explorer's table switch rides viewer.load(table), which upstream
deprecates in favour of load(client) plus restore({table}) -- but that path
merges the old view's columns into the new table's schema and is refused
(measured 2026-09-01: Unknown column SOURCE_TYPE in field columns). Exit the
deprecated path once upstream restores cleanly across tables, or switch via an
explicit clear-then-restore if the warning ever becomes a removal.
<<<
